---
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';
---
<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <span class="section-label">Who I Am</span>
    <h2 class="section-title reveal">About Me</h2>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-text reveal">
        <p>
          I'm <strong>Eliya Abbas</strong>, an <strong>AI Engineer and Data Scientist</strong> with experience in
          data analytics, Python, business intelligence and AI-driven application development. I work at the intersection of <strong>Machine Learning</strong>,
          <strong>Generative AI</strong>, <strong>LLM Evaluation</strong> and software engineering.
        </p>
        <p>
          As an <strong>AI Systems Evaluation Intern at AirDawg Labs</strong>, I evaluated LLMs through structured testing, code validation and
          benchmark-driven assessments (<strong>Terminal-Bench</strong>, <strong>SWE-Bench</strong>), using Docker, Linux, Git and WSL.
          Beyond evaluation, I build AI-powered assistants, automation and full-stack apps with <strong>FastAPI, React, Node.js and MongoDB</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          I'm particularly interested in building and evaluating intelligent systems that are not only capable,
          but also <strong>reliable, testable, and effective in real-world environments</strong>. I'm open to connecting with professionals in
          AI/ML Engineering, LLM Evaluation, Generative AI, Data Science and AI Systems Development.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="info-cards">
        <div class="info-card reveal">
          <div class="icon cyan"><Icon name="lucide:map-pin" size={20} /></div>
          <div class="info-card-content">
            <h3>Location</h3>
            <p>Mumbai, India</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card reveal">
          <div class="icon pink"><Icon name="lucide:graduation-cap" size={20} /></div>
          <div class="info-card-content">
            <h3>Education</h3>
            <p>B.E CSE (AI & ML) — Mumbai University</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-card reveal">
          <div class="icon green"><Icon name="lucide:bot" size={20} /></div>
          <div class="info-card-content">
            <h3>Focus Areas</h3>
            <p>LLM Evaluation, GenAI & ML, Full Stack, Data Analytics</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
